WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:-4
Out of noise, a rule that anyone can verify.

2
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.900 line:-4
SOVEREIGN STOCK TOKEN — SOST

3
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:23.400 line:-4
15 March 2026 · 18:00 UTC — the genesis block
An independent Layer 1 blockchain. No premine, no ICO.

4
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:30.600 line:-4
Every block links to the one before it, back to genesis.

5
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.600 line:-4
ConvergenceX — a memory-hard, sequential proof of work
100,000 rounds per attempt · 4 GB dataset · 4 GB scratchpad

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.800 line:-4
A reference miner built for ordinary CPUs.
Consensus does not enforce CPU-only mining.

7
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:51.800 line:-4
Every node re-checks every block.
Verification needs only a few megabytes.

8
00:00:53.400 --> 00:01:00.200 line:-4
V16 — active since block #25,000
Each block pays 50 % to its miner and 50 % to the DTD.

9
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:08.400 line:-4
DTD: one winner per block, drawn among recent miners.
DTD Jackpot: every 288 blocks, paid from the frozen consensus reserve.

10
00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:16.600 line:-4
Self-custodial web wallet · public Explorer · open-source nodes
Interfaces as shown on sostcore.com in November 2026.

11
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:27.200 line:-4
Universal Assets — registering and verifying real-world assets
In development and not active on mainnet. Tokenization is a later phase. Illustrative concept.

12
00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:34.600 line:-4
Block #40,000 — a planned milestone
V17 is a proposed upgrade in testing. It is not active and no release has been published.

13
00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:40.600 line:-4
wSOST on Ethereum — planned, not deployed
No wSOST contract and no bridge are in operation.

14
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:55.600 line:-4
SOST — Independent Layer 1 Blockchain
sostcore.com

